 """GenericAgentHandler — JSON-only file_write / file_patch (ONE-89).

+2026-05 (ONE-89) — Native-tool_calls models on Ollama Cloud /
+LM Studio / OpenAI emit ALL tool inputs through the OpenAI
+``arguments`` JSON object. The historical two-channel design
+(args carry path; sibling ``<file_content>...</file_content>`` text
+block carries content) breaks because the model's native-mode
+output has no "text channel" alongside the tool_call — content is
+lost, the tool errors, the model retries by emitting raw
+``<file_content>`` text without a tool_call (no parent dir
+created → ENOENT), and turn N+1 wedges with ``list index out of
+range`` from the no-tool-call exit path.
+
+Fix: file_write takes ``content`` as a JSON string arg.
+file_patch takes ``old_string`` + ``new_string`` JSON string args.
+The deprecated <file_content> path is retained as a legacy fallback
+for mlx-lm 0.31 Java tickets that still emit text-format; logs a
+one-time DEPRECATION WARN per ticket so we can see when it fires.
 """

 class GenericAgentHandler(BaseHandler):
